本项目基于开源项目 ppongtong/gesture-particle（MIT License）开发。
原项目的完整代码保留在仓库 upstream/ 目录中，其版权声明与许可条款不受影响。
手势识别、粒子物理与形态生成的核心算法继承自原项目，并附有代码级溯源注释。

This project is derived from the open-source project ppongtong/gesture-particle
(MIT License). The complete original source code is preserved in the upstream/
directory of this repository. The core algorithms for gesture recognition,
particle physics, and formation generation are inherited from the original
project, with code-level provenance annotations.
